  "summary": "STOCKHOLM, SWEDEN, June 26, 2025 — Neonode Inc. (NASDAQ: NEON) (the “Company” or “Neonode”) announced today that its 2025 Annual Meeting of Stockholders (the “Annual Meeting”), which was reconvened on June 26, 2025, was called to order and again adjourned without any business being conducted due to",
